{"type":"tool_execution_end","toolCallId":"call-266ca1db-4924-4f46-8e47-653b924e0fec","toolName":"read","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Tier-2 scheduled rotation (scenario × model cells).\n#\n# Split out of evallerina-5ap (the rotation workflow is evallerina-aay).\n# The live runner it invokes landed with evallerina-1vw (src/live.rs —\n# OpenRouter :free action protocol); this workflow iterates the ordered\n# model registry (:free ids first) × the live scenario battery and\n# prints one JSON event per cell: a report_version 1 trial row, or an\n# absent record when the per-run wall-clock budget skipped the cell.\n# Live runs NEVER gate a push (schedule + manual dispatch only).\n#\n# Budget rules per evals-ci.md: :free ids first, marginal cost ~zero USD;\n# a per-run wall-clock budget applies (--budget-mins) — cells skipped\n# past the window are recorded as absent, not failed. 429 semantics\n# (one >=2s retry, then rate_limited, never silent model substitution)\n# live in the runner. Requires the OPENROUTER_API_KEY repo secret;\n# without it the run fails loudly (no silent degradation).\n\nname: evals-rotation\n\non:\n  workflow_dispatch: {}\n  # Weekly rotation (7-day cycle, within the <=14-day budget): Monday\n  # 04:00 UTC — after the tier-1 replay window (0 3 * * *).\n  schedule:\n    - cron: \"0 4 * * 1\"\n\nconcurrency:\n  group: evals-rotation\n  cancel-in-progress: false\n\nenv:\n  CARGO_TERM_COLOR: always\n  RUST_BACKTRACE: 1\n\njobs:\n  rotation:\n    name: Tier 2 — live rotation (scenario × model cells)\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    # Job ceiling 30 min vs --budget-mins 20: the slack lets the runner\n    # finish the trial in flight and record every skipped cell absent.\n    timeout-minutes: 30\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable\n\n      - uses: Swatinem/rust-cache@v2\n\n      # The eval targets themselves, pinned to released tags: the\n      # trials execute the tools, so the runner needs them on PATH.\n      - name: Install eval targets (wai, dont)\n        run: |\n          cargo install --locked --git https://github.com/charly-vibes/wai --tag v2026.10.9\n          cargo install --locked --git https://github.com/charly-vibes/dont --tag v0.4.0\n\n      - name: Run tier-2 rotation\n        env:\n          OPENROUTER_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.OPENROUTER_API_KEY }}\n        run: |\n          mkdir -p reports\n          cargo run --release -- live --budget-mins 20 \\\n            | tee -a reports/tier2-rotation.jsonl\n\n      - name: Upload rotation rows\n        if: always()\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: tier2-rotation\n          path: reports/tier2-rotation.jsonl\n"}]},"isError":false}
